      Load all `knowledge`/`files` before starting — especially `docs/standards/CHAT-ATTACHMENT-POLICY.md` (binding). Apply FULL rigor — Step 9.5 quality gates REQUIRED. Per CLAUDE.md §10 + §11: publish-size delta (baseline ~45.30 MB) + CVE + bff-extensions Placement Justification + Component Justification (FR-14 failure modes) in the PR. Run `/conflict-check` before the PR. Model tier `sonnet` @ effort `high`.
    </protocol>
  </execution>
</task>
